+++ b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+The ``prerelease_token`` keyword of ``Version.next_version()`` is deprecated and emits a ``DeprecationWarning``. Use ``token`` instead, consistent with ``bump_prerelease`` and ``bump_build``.
